<title>INDONESIA: Telkom 9-mth net rises to 1.13 trln rph.</title>
<headline>Telkom 9-mth net rises to 1.13 trln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1,125.5 vs 878.4</p>
<p>Earnings per share (in rupiah) 120.59 vs 104.58  </p>
<p>    Operating revenue		3,695.82 vs 3,756.62</p>
<p>    Operating income		 1,553.80 vs 1,341.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   1,539.77 vs 1,257.54</p>
<p>Note: PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom), also listed in New York and London, is Indonesia's state-owned telecommunications firm.</p>
</text>
